MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T20:38:25-08:00","id":797635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=797629#post797629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bOk, cool. Are there any Atavisms for wall-climbing or web-spinning?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, but Infestation and the right Lair Traits should take you quite a long way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T02:15:31-08:00","id":797721,"title":"","content":"There's an Atavism here:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580599-other-atavism-ideas/page2\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580599-other-atavism-ideas/page2\"> Other Atavism Ideas? - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580599-other-atavism-ideas/page2\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580599-other-atavism-ideas/page2 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So I've been pondering other potential Atavisms for Beasts. Obviously the set we've got are very broad and cover a lot of potential Horror morphologies and associated powers. That said, I think I've got at least two more, so I'd like to land the other three minimum... - One for burrowing through earth and </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That has the web-spinning and wall-climbing covered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T07:01:06-08:00","id":797782,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=550624#post550624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-She was always a troubled kid. She had night terrors, and two years ago, she acquired he certitude that her older sister had been replaced by an alien. She tried to warn her parents, but they simply send her see a doctor who prescribed her some medication that made her too confused and apathetic to act.<br /> She didn't resent her parents though, since now too tired to flee the monster that hounded her dreams, she finally stopped running and faced it.<br /> Now aware of who and hat she really was she could comfront the thing living her sister's life. Things were tense for a while, but creature wasn't that bad, all things considered, they even became friends, but still, it doesn't give it the right to replace her sister (Family is important after all). She knows she'll have to do something about it soon, but she hasn't yet decided what it will be.<br /> Ideally she'd like to get her sister back. If it isn't possible... well someone will have to pay for that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Love this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T19:44:55-08:00","id":798068,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=797782#post797782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Love this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T20:55:04-08:00","id":798084,"title":"","content":"Wall Climbing is the low-satiety effect of Wings of the Raptor, though the other parts of it may not be ideal for you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T21:15:37-08:00","id":798090,"title":"","content":"-A Makara Ravager who specializes on destroying relationships. He particularly enjoys breaking up engagements by seducing one or both of the fianc\u00e9s; he never targets couples with children though. Monster or not, one must have standards after all. His best friend, an Ugallu Nemesis punishes the faithlessness of those who fall for her Ravager's partner's wiles by exposing their straying to their entourage.<br /> <br /> -An Anakim Collector who protects the bullied kids in her High School. She's a bit of a hero to the weakest and less popular students, always kind and ready to help. What they don't know is how she sublty encourage the bullies, so they'll drive more people to beg her for her protection.<br /> <br /> -A professional model Namtaru Predator who feeds on the youth and beauty of her rivals. It's for their own good, really: they have to learn that such superficial things can't be relied upon for they will inevitably fade in time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":1405,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","user":"Anteros","date":". 01-02-2016, 01:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T21:44:56-08:00","id":798100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=798090#post798090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-A Makara Ravager who specializes on destroying relationships. He particularly enjoys breaking up engagements by seducing one or both of the fianc\u00e9s; he never couples with children though. Monster or not, one must have standards after all. His best friend, an Ugallu Nemesis punishes the faithlessness of those who fall for her Ravager's partner's wiles by exposing their straying to their entourage.<br /> <br /> -An Anakim Collector who protects the bullied kids in her High School. She's a bit of a hero to the weakest and less popular students, always kind and ready to help. What they don't know is how she sublty encourage the bullies, so they'll drive more people to beg her for her protection.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Hungers feel off on these two; the MOs sound more like a Collector and a Tyrant, respectively.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T22:27:47-08:00","id":798112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=798100#post798100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Hungers feel off on these two; the MOs sound more like a Collector and a Tyrant, respectively.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Makara doesn't collect his victims. He seduces them, ruins their couples then moves on. Collectors hoard things, this caracter doesn't.<br /> The Anakim on the other hand, get more and more kids under her influence. She could indeed be a Tyrant, but she is more about amassing as many prot\u00e9g\u00e9s as she can than dominating people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T23:19:48-08:00","id":798127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=798112#post798112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Makara doesn't collect his victims. He seduces them, ruins their couples then moves on.</div> </div> </div> </div>The outliers for Ravager behavior are described in terms of how they apply the literal destruction of a subject to identifiable living things rather than objects. I suppose the logic might scan if he's in the habit of getting metaphysical with how he goes about orchestrating breakups, but breaking into someone's dreams to literal-metaphorically capsize their relationship seems like a lot of legwork.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Collectors hoard things, this caracter doesn't. </div> </div> </div>Collectors <i>deprive people of things</i>, which seems a more straightforward read of breaking up relationships than metaphorically applying the Hunger for arson and high-profile assassination.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Anakim on the other hand, get more and more kids under her influence. She could indeed be a Tyrant, but she is more about amassing as many prot\u00e9g\u00e9s as she can than dominating people. </div> </div> </div>I think you'd be hard-pressed to argue the bullies view their victims as things they want to have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T23:41:25-08:00","id":798134,"title":"","content":"I do tend to forget some of the changes made to the definitive version of the game. I've chosen to mostly use the 1st preview. Apart from the Apex thing because it's awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T11:36:17-08:00","id":798336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=798127#post798127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The outliers for Ravager behavior are described in terms of how they apply the literal destruction of a subject to identifiable living things rather than objects. I suppose the logic might scan if he's in the habit of getting metaphysical with how he goes about orchestrating breakups, but breaking into someone's dreams to literal-metaphorically capsize their relationship seems like a lot of legwork.</div> </div> </div> </div>I admit that I am biased since I had the same idea (a makara ravager destroying relationships by using the atavisms) but I think it fits perfectly: A ravager feeds on the reaction his destruction causes, the fact that the bystanders realise their own vulnerability and they wonder what will be destroyed next. And that could be achieved by demonstrating people the fragility of relationships by destroying them right? For example &quot;Alice and Bob were together for 20 years and then she cheated on him. No one suspected this and it might also happen to me.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10574-matthiasthalmann","name":"MatthiasThalmann","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T12:05:09-08:00","id":798343,"title":"","content":"I could imagine that character's Horror as a dragon, feeding off of the paranoia it incites in others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T13:24:06-08:00","id":798371,"title":"","content":"Is it just me, or is there an undertone of <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titanomachy\" target=\"_blank\">Titanomachy</a></b> in this game, where the Beasts are the Old Gods and the other monsters are the New Gods? That makes me want to come up with an Anakim who is both a Tyrant and a Ravager. His objective would be to overthrow his younger siblings, whom he sees as cowardly and in denial of their glorious heritage. His ultimate goal is the destruction of the carefully constructed masquerade of the other monsters, hence Ravager. After that is done, he would choose a few members of each splat to be his heralds or something like that, hence Tyrant. He could even be an Incarnate. Good material for a finale, methinks.<br /> <br /> I'm trying to think of a twist for this guy to make him stand out. What if he doesn't hate humans at all, and doesn't even think in terms like &quot;utopia for monsters, dystopia for humans&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T15:17:25-08:00","id":798420,"title":"","content":"I think that that would make an excellent antagonist in a crossover chronicle. If the PC group was composed of mixed Beasts/other supernaturals I could imagine a scene in which the antagonist rants on at the Beast PCs about his philosophy, trying to get them to betray their comrades and join him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T15:06:09-08:00","id":799821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=798420#post798420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that that would make an excellent antagonist in a crossover chronicle. If the PC group was composed of mixed Beasts/other supernaturals I could imagine a scene in which the antagonist rants on at the Beast PCs about his philosophy, trying to get them to betray their comrades and join him.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aaaaaand now I'm thinking about this re: a game with my Ready-Made PCs.<br /> <br /> I have things to be doing.<br /> <br /> THANKS.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T12:14:27-08:00","id":808925,"title":"","content":"Inspired by the Mistwraiths from Brandon Sanderson's Mistborn series.<br /> <br /> An Eshmaki Predator whose Lair's floor is covered in a carpet of bones. The Horror is nowhere to be seen, until you feel something grab one of your arms. You look down and a skeletal arm has grabbed you. You realise that the Horror was always here. You're standing on it.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how the Beast would actually feed though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T12:47:10-08:00","id":808968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=808925#post808925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An Eshmaki Predator whose Lair's floor is covered in a carpet of bones. The Horror is nowhere to be seen, until you feel something grab one of your arms. You look down and a skeletal arm has grabbed you. You realise that the Horror was always here. You're standing on it.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how the Beast would actually feed though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lurking from under the carpet and making mortals to flop on it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T12:48:38-08:00","id":808970,"title":"","content":"Do you mean the carpet of bones or a literal carpet?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T12:53:46-08:00","id":808976,"title":"","content":"Beast could remake literal carpet for the victim to look like carpet of bones ( by taking Lair Traits ) - carpet is large part of Lair idea, so it's always resonating with environment. Then Beast open a bit Primordial Pathways and let victim to see carpet change into bones, making silent &quot;om-nom-nom&quot; on her... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T12:55:56-08:00","id":808979,"title":"","content":"Interesting. I had this image of someone walking in the woods and they begin to hear crunching sounds under their feet. They look down at what they expect to be twigs or ticks and they're walking on bleached bones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T12:58:24-08:00","id":808986,"title":"","content":"Also, I don't mean to be rude or anything, but I don't suppose you could take a quick look at this. I'd just like another opinion. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804516-fansplat-revival-dragon-the-hunted\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...gon-the-hunted</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T13:14:53-08:00","id":809011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=808979#post808979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting. I had this image of someone walking in the woods and they begin to hear crunching sounds under their feet. They look down at what they expect to be twigs or ticks and they're walking on bleached bones.</div> </div> </div> </div>Totally awesome interpretation of &quot;Lair bleeding to reality&quot; - and by this, totally valid. Great, I will now still your character idea as NPC to mine games. Happy leaves walks in autumn park now... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T13:24:58-08:00","id":809022,"title":"","content":"My imagination creeps me out sometimes. Have you read the Mistborn series? It's a good one. The Mistwraiths are basically gelatinous creatures that consume other animals and use their bones to build themselves a makeshift skeleton. There's also a race of 'more advanced' misteraiths who call themselves Kandra and who can not only use someone's bones, but also their flesh, impersonating them perfectly. If that doesn't sound like a Beast, I don't know what does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T18:19:38-08:00","id":809277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=809022#post809022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My imagination creeps me out sometimes. Have you read the Mistborn series? It's a good one. The Mistwraiths are basically gelatinous creatures that consume other animals and use their bones to build themselves a makeshift skeleton. There's also a race of 'more advanced' misteraiths who call themselves Kandra and who can not only use someone's bones, but also their flesh, impersonating them perfectly. If that doesn't sound like a Beast, I don't know what does.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well if we're going to be fair the mimicry only came because Kandra studied individuals they'd be replacing. And don't forget the weird bodies they made out of any other substance they wanted just for the sake of differentiating themselves from humans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T20:24:34-08:00","id":809330,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=808925#post808925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inspired by the Mistwraiths from Brandon Sanderson's Mistborn series.<br /> <br /> An Eshmaki Predator whose Lair's floor is covered in a carpet of bones. The Horror is nowhere to be seen, until you feel something grab one of your arms. You look down and a skeletal arm has grabbed you. You realise that the Horror was always here. You're standing on it.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how the Beast would actually feed though.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I imagine they'd be similar to Martin Asher in <i>Taking Lives, </i>if you decided to go with the impersonation route, vis-a-vis studying your Prey, infiltrating their circles, then destroying them, either through murder or a frame up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T23:15:18-08:00","id":809393,"title":"","content":"The actual Horror in this one was going to basically be a mistwraith minus the gelatinousness. Just a creature of bones moving without muscles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-20T10:53:24-08:00","id":812721,"title":"","content":"The dream starts the same way every time: You're driving somewhere down the interstate. It's evening; the sun's going down. You notice that you're lower on fuel than you thought, so you pull off at the next exit to a gas station.<br /> <br /> The station itself is quiet. You're the only one around, save for a single figure you can't make out on the fringes. They're far enough away and it's dark enough now to be just a silhouette. Sometimes they're lit ever so slightly by the cherry speck of a cigarette, or the electric glow of a phone. A shiver runs down your spine, but it's nothing. Just a person. You notice a sign on the fuel pump: CARD READER BROKEN. PAY INSIDE.<br /> <br /> You go into the attached convenience store, with its soul-killing fluorescent lighting and rows of artery-clogging snack foods. You hand the tired-looking clerk some money and go back out to fill your car and get back on the highway before you lose too much time out here.<br /> <br /> In the middle of pumping, you casually notice the figure from earlier is gone. Must have walked off somewhere. Maybe they went to the bathroom or just finished their smoke break.<br /> <br /> A cold wind blows, causing you to shiver again.<br /> <br /> Or maybe. . .<br /> <br /> Suddenly, you feel a sharp pain in your leg, where your calf connects with your foot. Suddenly, you can't stand anymore. You start to fall, gripping onto the pump for feeble support. At the bottom of your descent, you see the black-gloved hand holding the dull-metal knife retreat back under your car. You scream, but no one can hear you--not out here in the sticks, not at this time of night.<br /> <br /> You've fallen victim to the Eshmaki Predator who haunts these parts of the dreamlands. Maybe next time you'll listen to your mother's admonishments about driving alone at night. Maybe next time you won't dismiss the urban legends as needless fearmongering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-20T11:01:26-08:00","id":812727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541856-beast-character-idea-thread?p=812721#post812721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The dream starts the same way every time: You're driving somewhere down the interstate. It's evening; the sun's going down. You notice that you're lower on fuel than you thought, so you pull off at the next exit to a gas station.<br /> <br /> The station itself is quiet. You're the only one around, save for a single figure you can't make out on the fringes. They're far enough away and it's dark enough now to be just a silhouette. Sometimes they're lit ever so slightly by the cherry speck of a cigarette, or the electric glow of a phone. A shiver runs down your spine, but it's nothing. Just a person. You notice a sign on the fuel pump: CARD READER BROKEN. PAY INSIDE.<br /> <br /> You go into the attached convenience store, with its soul-killing fluorescent lighting and rows of artery-clogging snack foods. You hand the tired-looking clerk some money and go back out to fill your car and get back on the highway before you lose too much time out here.<br /> <br /> In the middle of pumping, you casually notice the figure from earlier is gone. Must have walked off somewhere. Maybe they went to the bathroom or just finished their smoke break.<br /> <br /> A cold wind blows, causing you to shiver again.<br /> <br /> Or maybe. . .<br /> <br /> Suddenly, you feel a sharp pain in your leg, where your calf connects with your foot. Suddenly, you can't stand anymore. You start to fall, gripping onto the pump for feeble support. At the bottom of your descent, you see the black-gloved hand holding the dull-metal knife retreat back under your car. You scream, but no one can hear you--not out here in the sticks, not at this time of night.<br /> <br /> You've fallen victim to the Eshmaki Predator who haunts these parts of the dreamlands. Maybe next time you'll listen to your mother's admonishments about driving alone at night. Maybe next time you won't dismiss the urban legends as needless fearmongering.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> *Shivers* Oooh. Creeeeeepy. I like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-20T14:17:57-08:00","id":812889,"title":"","content":"Is it just me, or are Biblical angels a mix of Anakim and Namtaru? As beings who were created by and answer only to God Himself, they have the power to eradicate whole empires and reap countless lives without effort or mortals having any say in the matter. As if that wasn't enough, they wouldn't look out of place among a gathering of Great Old Ones:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Their whole body, their backs, their hands, their wings and the wheels were full of eyes all around, the wheels belonging to all four of them. The wheels were called in my hearing, the whirling wheels. And each one had four faces. The first face was the face of a cherub, the second face was the face of a man, the third the face of a lion, and the fourth the face of an eagle. - <b>Book Of Ezekiel 10:12-14</b> </div> </div> </div>This makes me imagine Beasts who believe they are divine agents on a mission that lasts a human lifetime, or who wear divine trappings for deception and amusement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 01-20-2016, 05:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-22T03:51:17-08:00","id":814026,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking of a Beast inspired/originatng from the Lady of the Lake. Who's not really popular among other Beasts, as its commonly believed that Arthur was a Hero and she/her predecessor gave him a Beast-slaying weapon...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1355-horvagab","name":"horvagab","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1355_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-22T07:39:45-08:00","id":814119,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sorry, I meant to put up that on the Other Atavism Ideas? thread. Got confused</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 01-22-2016, 11:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-22T15:34:02-08:00","id":814495,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div cla