d threatening to incinerate those caught in the blaze. And yet, if one wishes to meet the master of this realm, they must move towards the flames. Locating the center point of the destruction, where the Wyrm of the Ring sits within a glade of ash and charcoal.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Family:</b> Ugallu<br /> <br /> <b>Hunger:</b> Destruction<br /> <br /> <b>Horror:</b> A great, winged dragon with body scales as black as ink and underscales that reflect the color of nightshade. Their eyes gleam like red rubies in their sockets and wisps of black smoke leak from the corners of its maw.<br /> <br /> <b>Life:</b> Loyal - the Wyrm of the Ring takes care of those close to them and is willing to flout the rules if it means keeping them safe from harm. He's definitely the kind of guy you want on your side.<br /> <br /> <b>Legend:</b> Unexpected - when moved by aggression, the Wyrm of the Ring has all the grace of a bomber pilot. Swooping in from out of nowhere and unleashing chaos and devastation upon their targets<br /> <br /> <b>Lair:</b> Undergrowth, Thin Air, Stinging, Burning<br /> <br /> <b>Atavisms:</b> Dragonfire, Wings of the Raptor, Limb from Limb, Unbreakable<br /> <br /> <b>Nightmares:</b> Behold my True Form, Run, Fear is Contagious</div> </div> </div> </div>....stolen!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-13T05:50:57-07:00","id":1077661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=